        "Per-position adapter state.",
        "",
        "`seeds = [ADAPTER_STATE_SEED, jupiter_lp_program_id, position]`",
        "",
        "`header.total_shares` tracks JLP held (the adapter's native share unit)."
      ],
      "type": {
        "kind": "struct",
        "fields": [
          {
            "name": "header",
